  "contentHtml": "<p class=\"cafe-editor-text\">#전류에의한자기장 #자기장 #mri #앙페르법칙 #원형도선에의한자기장 #전자석 #솔레노이드<br><br><br>--------------------아래에 설명을 추가해주세요^^<br></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">자기공명영상장치(MRI)는 </span><span style=\"color: rgb(55, 58, 60); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Magnetic Resonance Imaging 의 약자로서,</span></p><p><font color=\"#373a3c\" face=\"Open Sans, arial, Apple SD Gothic Neo, Noto Sans CJK KR, 본고딕, KoPubDotum, 나눔바른고딕, 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, 맑은고딕, Malgun Gothic, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.4px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">솔레노이드에 강한 전류를 흘려주어, 내부에 </span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">강하고 균일한 자기장을 만들고,</span></span></font></p><p><font color=\"#373a3c\" face=\"Open Sans, arial, Apple SD Gothic Neo, Noto Sans CJK KR, 본고딕, KoPubDotum, 나눔바른고딕, 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, 맑은고딕, Malgun Gothic, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.4px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">자기장속에서&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">환자로부터 발생되는&nbsp;신호를 수집하여 영상으로 만드는 장치입니다.</span></span></font></p><p><font color=\"#373a3c\" face=\"Open Sans, arial, Apple SD Gothic Neo, Noto Sans CJK KR, 본고딕, KoPubDotum, 나눔바른고딕, 나눔고딕, NanumGothic, 맑은고딕, Malgun Gothic, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14.4px;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">그러니, 금속을 들고 들어가면&nbsp;안되겠죠?</span></span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/994288425F28D7CC29\" class=\"txc-image\" actualwidth=\"640\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" width=\"640\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"BrightShyCusimanse-mobile.gif\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"  id=\"A_994288425F28D7CC292ADF\"/></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/993E43425F28DE9F2C\" class=\"txc-image\" actualwidth=\"512\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" width=\"512\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"unnamed.gif\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"  id=\"A_993E43425F28DE9F2C1F11\"/></p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/993E2C425F28DEA02C\" class=\"txc-image\" actualwidth=\"942\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" width=\"942\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"MRI.jpg\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"  id=\"A_993E2C425F28DEA02C57F1\"/></p><p>*참고 : CT : 방사선(x-ray)를 입체적으로 찍은 것 (뼈가 방사선을 투과 못하므로 희게 나옴.)</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/991D52455F2B882703\" class=\"txc-image\" hspace=\"1\" vspace=\"1\" border=\"0\" actualwidth=\"481\" width=\"481\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"다운로드.jpg\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"  id=\"A_991D52455F2B88270313AC\"/></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p><br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
